.pytest_cache
.venv
*.pyc

# The raw authoring trees for AI-coding rounds and take-home assignments
# (ROUNDS-00A-L02). build.py compiles them into definitions/ at author
# time; the runner reads round and assignment content from PocketBase and
# the compiled definitions, never these files, so the hidden tests and
# harnesses in them never reach the image. build.py itself runs only on a
# full checkout (the definitions CI job), never in the image.
ai_coding/rounds
take_home/assignments
